Features: normalized position and unit tangent blocks.
Perigee: first noninitial geocentric minimum outside lunar SOI within each interval, before any detected surface entry.
Frame: geocentric inertial axes coincident with synodic axes at t=0.
STD: ddof=0; w statistics use offsets from the cluster circular mean (angle_origin_deg).
angle_resultant: 1=concentrated directions; 0=no defined mean direction. Broad angular clouds require caution with linearized moments.
NaN: missing event, undefined parameter/statistic, or missing representative parameter.
